{"id":"z03-16","volume":3,"volumeTitle":"周纪三","volumeSubtitle":"前305","index":16,"title":{"t":"赧王十年","s":"赧王十年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀三 · 前305 · 丙辰","s":"周纪三 · 前305 · 丙辰"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"彗星在天上出现了。","tokens":[{"t":"彗","s":"彗","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"星","s":"星","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"見","s":"见","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"赵王出兵攻打中山，拿下丹丘、爽阳和鸿之塞，接着又拿下鄗、石邑、封龙、东垣。","tokens":[{"t":"趙","s":"赵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"中","s":"中","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"山","s":"山","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"丹","s":"丹","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"丘","s":"丘","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"爽","s":"爽","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陽","s":"阳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"鴻","s":"鸿","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"塞","s":"塞","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"又","s":"又","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"鄗","s":"鄗","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"石","s":"石","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"邑","s":"邑","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra